Important Note

The current decision engine is primarily rule-based.

Machine-learning-based anomaly detection is planned as a future component of ACTDRS.

Therefore, the current prototype should not be considered a complete AI-based cybersecurity platform.

Project Goal

The long-term goal of ACTDRS is to develop a lightweight, explainable and locally deployable cybersecurity monitoring and response prototype that can detect suspicious activity, assist in making security decisions, automatically respond to selected threats, and verify system recovery.
